        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An ISCM capability that identifies vulnerabilities [Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs)] on devices that are likely to be used by attackers to compromise a device and use it as a platform from which to extend compromise to the network.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://openark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKControlTerminology#"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Threat and vulnerability management</rdfs:label>
